          "id": 1983163352,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The packet list header font, at least on Qt 6, is affected by the system font settings and scaling: https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/16922#note_1896053230\n\nUnlike the main font for the packet list. How does this change interact with that scaling, or changing the scaling while the application is running?",
